.row.pb-1.has-border-top.mt-3.pt-3
    .col-md-12
        h3([textContent]='translate.trans("changelogs.title")')
    .col-md-12.mb-2
        p.mb-0([textContent]='translate.trans("changelogs.description")')
    .col-md-12
        .row
            .col-md-12.changelog-table-wrap
                table.table.table-striped.table-bordered.table-hover.table-sm.changelog-table
                    thead
                        tr
                            th([textContent]='translate.trans("changelogs.column_version")')
                            th([textContent]='translate.trans("changelogs.column_date")')
                            th([textContent]='translate.trans("changelogs.column_description")')
                    tbody
                        tr
                            td 1.8.0
                            td 2026-09-02
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Added secure Dropbox PKCE authentication with automatic callback handling and a manual fallback.
                                    li Added custom AES-256-GCM encryption with operating-system keychain storage and legacy-data compatibility.
                                    li Added a secure unlock flow for encrypted Dropbox data to prevent accidental cloud overwrites.
                                    li Improved conflict detection, safe conflict backups, synchronization pausing, and local snapshot recovery.
                                    li Added toolbar and command-palette actions for syncing and opening Cloud Sync settings.
                                    li Prevented conflicts with Tabby's built-in configuration sync and improved retry behavior after repeated failures.
                                    li Expanded provider disconnect cleanup while keeping cloud files untouched.
                                    li Improved the settings interface, accessibility, synchronization status, publishing workflow, and automated test coverage.
                        tr
                            td 1.6.5
                            td 2024-10-14
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Official Dropbox support.
                                    li Plugin log viewer.
                                    li Faster, more reliable syncing.
                                    li Bug fixes.
                                    li UI updates to match newer Tabby releases.
                        tr
                            td 1.6.0
                            td 2023-02-17
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Configurable sync interval.
                                    li Fixed the WebDAV first-time sync issue.
                                    li Improved update checks.
                                    li Added the ability to roll back to an earlier version.
                                    li Added the sponsor list.
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.5.2
                            td 2022-11-19
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Configurable sync interval.
                                    li Added the Updates tab.
                                    li Added in-app update checks and installation.
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.5.1
                            td 2022-08-16
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Added in-app feedback, changelog, and donation links.
                                    li Improved the user interface.
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.5.0
                            td 2022-07-17
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Official support for S3-compatible storage such as MinIO.
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.4.3
                            td ...
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.4.0
                            td 2022-05-22
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Automatic sync, including changes made on other machines.
                                    li Fixed critical bugs.
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.3.0
                            td 2021-12-21
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Added FTP / FTPS port settings.
                                    li Added Gist support (GitHub, GitLab).
                                    li Tabby settings are backed up before the first sync.
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.2.2
                            td 2021-08-24
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Added support for Backblaze B2 storage.
                        tr
                            td 1.2.1
                            td 2021-08-21
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Added support for DigitalOcean Spaces.
                        tr
                            td 1.2.0
                            td 2021-08-19
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Added support for Wasabi cloud storage.
                        tr
                            td 1.1.3
                            td 2021-08-14
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Added logging.
                                    li Minor bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.0.2
                            td 2021-08-07
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li Improved encryption of the settings file.
                                    li Bug fixes.
                        tr
                            td 1.0.0
                            td 2021-08-01
                            td
                                ul.mb-0.pl-3
                                    li First release of the plugin.
                                    li Added support for Amazon S3, FTP, and WebDAV.
    .col-md-12.pt-3.text-right
        button.btn.btn-warning.flex-shrink-0.ml-3.mb-2((click)='openPluginPage()')
            i.fas.fa-fw.fa-link.mr-2
            span([textContent]='translate.trans("buttons.visit_plugin_page")')
